@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="fw-bold" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted fs-5">
            At <strong>Hotel Royal</strong>, we value your privacy and are committed to safeguarding your personal data.
            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">1. Introduction</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                This Privacy Policy describes the principles and practices applied by Hotel Royal in relation to personal
                data collection, storage, and use. By using our website, booking services, or visiting our property,
                you agree to the terms outlined here.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">2. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                We may collect the following categories of personal data:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Personal details (name, surname, gender, nationality, date of birth)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Contact details (email, phone number, address)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Payment details (credit/debit card information, billing address)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Booking details (dates of stay, room type, preferences)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Website data (IP address, browser type, cookies, device information)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">3. How We Use Your Data</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                The information we collect is used strictly for the following purposes:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-2">✔ To process and confirm your reservations</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ To provide a personalized guest experience</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ To comply with legal and regulatory requirements</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ For marketing and promotional communication (only with your consent)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ To ensure the safety and security of our guests and staff</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">4. Data Sharing</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                We do not sell your personal information. However, we may share your data with:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Payment providers and banks (for transaction processing)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Legal authorities when required by law</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Trusted service providers (IT, marketing, guest support)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">5. Data Retention</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was
                collected or as required by applicable law. Typically, guest booking records are stored for up to 5 years.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">6. Security Measures</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                We implement industry-standard security measures, including encryption, secure servers,
                and restricted access to ensure that your data remains safe from unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">7. Your Rights</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                Under data protection laws, you have the right to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Request corrections or updates</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Request deletion of your data (when legally permissible)</li>
                <li class="mb-2">✔ Withdraw consent to marketing communication</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">8. Cookies</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                Our website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. You may disable cookies in your browser settings,
                but please note that some features of the website may not function properly.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">9. Updates to This Policy</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in legislation,
                technology, or our practices. Any updates will be published on this page with a revised “Last Updated” date.
            </p>

            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">10. Contact Information</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">
                If you have any questions or concerns regarding our Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
            </p>
            <address class="text-muted">
                <strong>Presidential Hotel</strong><br />
                Pavla Skoropadsky St. 57, Kyiv, Ukraine<br />
                Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@presidentialhotel.com">privacy@presidentialhotel.com</a><br />
                Phone: +380 445 372 260
            </address>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-light rounded shadow-sm">
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Quick Links</h5>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li><a href="/Home/About" class="text-decoration-none">About Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/Home/Index#services" class="text-decoration-none">Our Services</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-light rounded shadow-sm">
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">Last Updated</h5>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">September 16, 2025</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
